      sha256 aef4d9827596037e89468062eae3d39ae7137f0500d827c0bc0fce3dad8e403e
  ✓ live : cargo test -- --ignored ⇒ real /api/mobile/config satisfies protocol::config
  ✓ runtime : window opened ⊗ notice "Sign in with your apocky.com account." ⇒ bootstrap reached.service
  ✓ site : npm run check clean ; next build clean ; .next/server/pages/download/apocrypha.html
           carries installer href + sidecar href + exact sha256 + unsigned-warning copy
  ✓ tests/lib/desktop-release.test.tsx + native-mobile-release.test.tsx wired → npm run test:apocrypha-downloads
